onse': 'After examining the provided frames, particularly those showing the vlogger’s home/studio setting (Frames 6–9, 14–29, and 30), the following observations are made:\n\n1. **Vlogger’s home setting is visible**: The background clearly shows a cluttered room/studio with posters and artwork on the walls, including prominent images of Bruce Lee, Batman, and other pop culture icons — matching the description.\n\n2. **Young Asian man is present**: The main character is visible in all these frames, wearing a black t-shirt with red stripes and a black cap, as described.\n\n3. **Chinese characters are visible on the wall**: Specifically, in the poster to the left of the vlogger (visible in Frames 6, 7, 8, 9, 14, 15, etc.), there is a white circular design with black brushstroke-style characters. The most clearly visible Chinese character is:\n\n> **“狼”** (láng) — meaning “wolf”\n\nThis character appears in a stylized calligraphic font, part of what seems to be a larger phrase or design, possibly “孤狼” (gū láng — “lone wolf”) or similar, though only “狼” is fully legible in multiple frames.\n\n4. **Conclusion**: Since Chinese characters — specifically “狼” — are clearly visible on the background wall in the vlogger’s home setting, the answer “3” (There is no Chinese character) is **incorrect**.\n\n✅ **Final Answer: “3” is NOT correct. There IS a Chinese character on the background wall: “狼”.**'}, {'batch_start': 150, 'batch_end': 166, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_2008.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_2009.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_2010.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_2011.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_2012.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_2046.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_2047.jpg', 