nd wall of the vlogger’s home. The specific characters are **“必勝”**.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is **not '0'** — it should be **“必勝”**.\n\n✅ **Final Answer: 必勝**"}, {'batch_start': 240, 'batch_end': 270, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0910.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0911.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0912.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0913.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0914.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0915.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0916.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0917.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0918.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0919.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0920.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0921.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0922.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0923.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0924.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0925.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0926.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0927.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0972.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0973.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0974.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0975.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/2zkJFv-ro4A/frames/frame_0976.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/vid